
660:Riu Kujou
661:I'm Riu Kujou. As you can see, I'm a maid.
662:I'm 19 years old.
665:Riu Kujou rubs her stiff face and shifts her gaze from the lens pointing right at her and looks irritably at me filming her with the action camera.
666:Great, the tenth filming attempt is now also a failure.
