672:Chihori Terasaki
673:Yes.
674:Have you made a mistake? I'm not a celebrity. I'm just a maid.
675:I'm doing a special report on modern professional maids this time. I've heard a lot about you from {var:player_nickname}, who tells me you're an exceptional maid.
