845:Several days later
846:Huh? Isn't this good enough?
847:Well, I can say that the content is unremarkable. These are all things the audience will immediately think of when they see the theme. Although her various skills are amazing, they don't stand out enough when compared with what you can find on the Internet nowadays.
848:I don't think there's a need to publish this content at all. Sorry, I don't really mince my words.
849:However, when we meet Chihori Terasaki again at the Mahjong Soul Shrine, she makes some very sharp comments after seeing the material.
851:Riu Kujou lowers her head silently and is very disappointed with the result. Feeling bad for her, I ask Chihori Terasaki a question.
853:It's too late for that. We don't get much time to choose a theme for the special report, so I've already prepared something else instead.
855:{var:player_nickname}, based on what you told me about Miss Kujou, I got the impression that she's very interesting as a person. It's a shame that you didn't manage to capture the things that make her shine.
856:But I know you two worked very hard. Since I asked Miss Kujou to help me, I'll give her that teddy bear.
857:?!
