901:Sigh... I thought it would be really easy, but there's actually such a formal interview element to complete.
902:Looking back at the past few failed recording sessions, the first time was because Riu Kujou spoke too softly, the second time was because she didn't remember the interview questions and kept looking at the little card in her hand, and the third time was because she got too nervous and said she wasn't nervous... Without realizing it, we had already spent an hour on the opening self-introduction.
903:You're right... it's not like me at all to be so depressed. Ahem, I'm ready. Let's try again!
