957:On that day, Riu Kujou and I managed to successfully complete the filming mission that Chihori Terasaki assigned to us... Riu Kujou got the teddy bear she wanted, and I got something even more precious--I got to see sides of Riu Kujou that make her more real and vivid to me than ever.
